WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.210
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.480 --> 00:12.039
[Episode 5]

3
00:37.880 --> 00:39.239
Don't let him get away!

4
00:43.320 --> 00:44.633
After him!

5
00:51.801 --> 00:53.200
Quick, after him!

6
00:57.201 --> 00:58.560
Stop!

7
01:06.400 --> 01:07.761
Stop right there!

8
01:15.081 --> 01:16.521
After him!

9
01:24.961 --> 01:27.280
Mr. Zhao! Come with me!

10
01:30.920 --> 01:32.360
Behind you! Watch out!

11
01:35.608 --> 01:37.087
Zhao Sheng Ge?

12
01:54.441 --> 01:57.161
Mr. Zhao, why are you here?

13
01:57.161 --> 01:58.601
What do you think?

14
01:59.480 --> 02:01.480
What a coincidence.

15
02:20.560 --> 02:21.840
For the sake of the bidding,

16
02:21.840 --> 02:23.960
you'd risk everything, wouldn't you?

17
02:26.120 --> 02:28.041
Thank you, Mr. Zhao.

18
02:28.041 --> 02:30.801
I haven't thanked you for taking me to Eagle Nest yet.

19
02:30.801 --> 02:32.560
How is that the same?

20
02:32.560 --> 02:33.841
It was so dangerous this time.

21
02:33.841 --> 02:35.721
So, you knew it was dangerous.

22
02:36.328 --> 02:38.521
I thought you were oblivious.

23
02:38.521 --> 02:41.361
Mr. Zhao, every path has been cleared.

24
02:41.361 --> 02:43.680
The boss says you did a great job.

25
02:43.680 --> 02:45.300
Your year-end bonus will be doubled.

26
02:45.300 --> 02:46.360
Thank you, sir!

27
02:46.360 --> 02:48.921
But we agreed that you'd stay in the car.

28
02:48.921 --> 02:50.680
Why did you suddenly rush out?

29
02:50.680 --> 02:51.761
Simon.

30
02:51.761 --> 02:53.520
Your year-end bonus is gone.

31
02:58.400 --> 02:59.400
You saw it, too.

32
02:59.400 --> 03:02.481
Luo Gan Sheng had men lying in wait on every road.

33
03:02.481 --> 03:04.400
In the face of such absolute power,

34
03:04.400 --> 03:07.680
any little trick seems like child's play.

35
03:09.201 --> 03:11.000
I was too naive.

36
03:11.000 --> 03:13.120
You're much more thorough, Mr. Zhao.

37
03:13.120 --> 03:15.801
I don't want your compliments.

38
03:15.801 --> 03:18.121
I want you to be safe.

39
03:21.361 --> 03:22.880
Thank you, Mr. Zhao.

40
03:22.880 --> 03:25.961
If you ever need anything from me, please don't hesitate to ask.

41
03:25.961 --> 03:27.400
What are you doing?

42
03:28.400 --> 03:30.521
Mr. Chen, we've arrived.

43
03:30.521 --> 03:32.413
Thank you.

44
03:32.413 --> 03:34.053
Thank you, Mr. Zhao.

45
03:46.321 --> 03:48.160
Lukas.

46
03:48.160 --> 03:50.321
Your year-end bonus is gone, too.

47
03:51.941 --> 03:53.461
Understood, Mr. Zhao.

48
03:55.840 --> 03:58.361
Luo Gan Sheng, you are charged in Case 023,

49
03:58.361 --> 03:59.840
for a major foreign trade smuggling case.

50
03:59.840 --> 04:01.201
Criminals colluded with officials

51
04:01.201 --> 04:03.321
to transport prohibited goods illegally.

52
04:03.321 --> 04:05.441
Do you accept these charges?

53
04:06.321 --> 04:08.160
Nonsense.

54
04:08.160 --> 04:10.041
Investigate all you want.

55
04:10.041 --> 04:12.680
Next, we invite the third-party monitor

56
04:12.680 --> 04:14.521
and witness to take the stand.

57
04:14.521 --> 04:16.561
Name of the witness.

58
04:16.561 --> 04:17.960
Chen Wan.

59
04:24.240 --> 04:25.920
Mr. Zhao.

60
04:25.920 --> 04:27.280
It's over.

61
04:28.280 --> 04:30.800
Wait for me here.

62
04:30.800 --> 04:33.280
There are no other hearings today, right?

63
04:33.881 --> 04:35.961
If I only said "thank you" now,

64
04:35.961 --> 04:37.920
it wouldn't seem like enough.

65
04:37.920 --> 04:40.840
How about I treat you to dinner, Mr. Zhao?

66
04:43.521 --> 04:45.240
All right.

67
04:45.240 --> 04:46.600
Chen Wan!

68
04:47.240 --> 04:48.961
Are you out of your mind?

69
04:48.961 --> 04:50.480
You actually testified against him?

70
04:50.480 --> 04:52.600
I wouldn't have known if others hadn't told me!

71
04:52.600 --> 04:54.067
Where did you get the nerve?

72
04:54.067 --> 04:56.920
Xuan, calm down.

73
04:56.920 --> 04:59.961
Do you know who's behind that animal?

74
04:59.961 --> 05:02.280
You think one hearing can take him down?

75
05:02.280 --> 05:04.321
I'm telling you, you're too naive.

76
05:04.321 --> 05:05.321
You're just a pawn.

77
05:05.321 --> 05:07.840
Once you lose your leverage, you'll be at their mercy!

78
05:07.840 --> 05:09.121
All right, don't be like this.

79
05:09.121 --> 05:10.160
Stop it.

80
05:10.160 --> 05:11.280
I can't help it.

81
05:11.280 --> 05:12.681
I can't stop him.

82
05:14.521 --> 05:18.240
Everyone, I'll explain everything to Xuan.

83
05:18.240 --> 05:19.561
If you'll excuse us.

84
05:19.561 --> 05:22.040
Xuan. Let me explain.

85
05:33.240 --> 05:34.441
Xuan.

86
05:34.441 --> 05:36.001
This is how business works.

87
05:36.001 --> 05:40.360
Since I want that project, I have to pay the price.

88
05:40.360 --> 05:43.881
In the end, you still don't trust me.

89
05:43.881 --> 05:45.920
You won't tell me anything.

90
05:45.920 --> 05:48.480
If only I were more capable...

91
05:48.480 --> 05:51.240
I'm just a young master in name only.

92
05:51.240 --> 05:52.561
When it comes to your problems,

93
05:52.561 --> 05:54.081
I can't help you with anything.

94
05:54.081 --> 05:56.200
What are you talking about?

95
05:57.160 --> 05:58.400
I know.

96
05:58.400 --> 06:00.321
I'm useless.

97
06:00.321 --> 06:02.400
But isn't there Tan You Ming?

98
06:02.400 --> 06:04.641
If not him, there's Shen Zong Nian.

99
06:04.641 --> 06:07.360
If all else fails, I'll beg Zhao Sheng Ge.

100
06:07.360 --> 06:09.681
I'll go and beg him in person.

101
06:09.681 --> 06:13.160
Is there anything in Hai City that Zhao Sheng Ge can't solve?

102
06:13.160 --> 06:14.561
Chen Wan.

103
06:14.561 --> 06:16.521
You're always like this.

104
06:16.521 --> 06:17.761
So stubborn.

105
06:17.761 --> 06:19.321
You never listen to anyone.

106
06:19.321 --> 06:22.160
You refuse to accept help from others.

107
06:22.160 --> 06:24.081
Didn't I accept Zhao Sheng Ge's help?

108
06:24.081 --> 06:25.840
You call that accepting help?

109
06:25.840 --> 06:28.240
You were forced to.

110
06:28.240 --> 06:30.001
What if Zhao Sheng Ge hadn't shown up?

111
06:30.001 --> 06:32.960
Would I even be here yelling at you right now?

112
06:33.840 --> 06:36.641
Is Zhao Sheng Ge really that special?

113
06:36.641 --> 06:38.920
Why can't we trouble him?

114
06:38.920 --> 06:41.840
Is he really that noble and great?

115
06:42.480 --> 06:43.961
Xuan.

116
06:43.961 --> 06:46.201
This is the path I chose.

117
06:46.201 --> 06:48.280
Since I chose it, I have to bear the consequences.

118
06:48.280 --> 06:49.561
Chen Wan.

119
06:49.561 --> 06:51.521
To be honest,

120
06:51.521 --> 06:53.441
I know Tan You Ming and Shen Zong Nian

121
06:53.441 --> 06:54.681
aren't really your friends.

122
06:54.681 --> 06:57.040
Don't even try to deny it.

123
06:57.040 --> 06:59.920
You think that because you seem attentive and helpful to everyone,

124
06:59.920 --> 07:00.961
I can't see through it?

125
07:00.961 --> 07:04.121
You keep everyone at a distance.

126
07:04.121 --> 07:05.881
Forget about them.

127
07:05.881 --> 07:07.800
But what about me?

128
07:07.800 --> 07:10.480
Do you even consider me a friend?

129
07:10.480 --> 07:12.001
Xuan.

130
07:12.001 --> 07:14.280
I don't have any other friends.

131
07:14.280 --> 07:16.400
I only have you.

132
07:16.400 --> 07:18.321
Then why must you take this risk?

133
07:18.321 --> 07:20.840
Why must you throw your life away?

134
07:22.761 --> 07:24.121
Xuan.

135
07:24.920 --> 07:26.201
Do you know who the top official

136
07:26.201 --> 07:28.761
of Xiaolan Mountain was 16 years ago?

137
07:32.521 --> 07:34.361
You mean...

138
07:35.961 --> 07:37.400
Exactly.

139
07:38.240 --> 07:40.881
This is the only thing I can do.

140
07:40.881 --> 07:44.641
Regardless of whether I succeed, I still want to try.

141
07:44.641 --> 07:47.561
I absolutely cannot let Luo Gan Sheng get away with this.

142
07:52.920 --> 07:55.640
Even if it's something this big...

143
07:56.920 --> 07:59.960
you can't just go in alone like that.

144
08:02.321 --> 08:04.400
I'm glad they found out.

145
08:06.840 --> 08:08.920
Unless you've walked in their shoes,

146
08:08.920 --> 08:10.881
don't tell others to be kind.

147
08:12.521 --> 08:14.761
Forget about Luo Gan Sheng for a moment.

148
08:15.800 --> 08:17.081
But when it comes to business,

149
08:17.081 --> 08:19.961
can you stop putting your life on the line?

150
08:19.961 --> 08:22.121
If this deal doesn't work, there's always the next one,

151
08:22.121 --> 08:23.360
and the one after that.

152
08:23.360 --> 08:26.241
Do you have to take on every single one?

153
08:27.321 --> 08:29.280
Look at yourself now.

154
08:29.280 --> 08:30.961
You're like a ghost of your former self.

155
08:30.961 --> 08:32.201
I really don't know if one day you'll just...

156
08:32.201 --> 08:33.281
Xuan.

157
08:33.281 --> 08:35.161
I'm not mistreating myself.

158
08:35.161 --> 08:37.241
You're not mistreating yourself?

159
08:38.760 --> 08:40.961
You're not mistreating yourself?

160
08:42.120 --> 08:44.681
Monica told me you haven't picked up your medicine in two weeks.

161
08:44.681 --> 08:46.801
Actually, I've already made an appointment with Monica.

162
08:46.801 --> 08:48.321
I'll definitely go this weekend.

163
08:48.321 --> 08:49.520
I've set a reminder this time.

164
08:49.520 --> 08:51.760
I'll definitely be there on time.

165
08:51.760 --> 08:54.481
Why do you always worry about inconveniencing others?

166
08:54.481 --> 08:57.281
What matters is your own health.

167
08:57.281 --> 08:59.441
Do you even take it seriously?

168
08:59.441 --> 09:01.520
I know what I'm doing.

169
09:01.520 --> 09:03.360
What do you know?

170
09:03.360 --> 09:05.360
Send me the new appointment time.

171
09:05.360 --> 09:07.640
I'll escort you there myself.

172
09:07.640 --> 09:09.161
Okay.

173
09:09.161 --> 09:10.800
I'll do as you say.

174
09:30.041 --> 09:31.561
By the way, Wan...

175
09:31.561 --> 09:33.600
Tan You Ming and the others wanted me to ask you something.

176
09:33.600 --> 09:35.281
Since they're working with Baisheng Group,

177
09:35.281 --> 09:36.880
he wants you to come and help out.

178
09:36.880 --> 09:38.640
Will you join?

179
09:38.640 --> 09:42.001
I don't know if it's appropriate to ask this now...

180
09:49.161 --> 09:50.921
Will he be there?

181
09:50.921 --> 09:52.201
Who cares if he goes or not?

182
09:52.201 --> 09:54.441
Go if you want to, don't if you don't.

183
09:54.441 --> 09:55.721
I'll go.

184
09:56.921 --> 09:59.401
Oh, remember to bring two bottles of wine.

185
09:59.401 --> 10:00.640
There's a cocktail party.

186
10:00.640 --> 10:03.000
He Sheng Yuan invited a Norwegian royal.

187
10:03.000 --> 10:05.921
They'll play a traditional game at the party.

188
10:05.921 --> 10:06.961
I think it's called...

189
10:06.961 --> 10:08.321
the Secret Exchange Game.

190
10:08.321 --> 10:11.201
One bottle is used as a blind box for someone to draw.

191
10:11.201 --> 10:15.201
The other is placed in the common area for everyone to taste.

192
10:49.081 --> 10:52.480
Mr. Chen, if you don't like any of the wines currently on the market,

193
10:52.480 --> 10:55.961
why don't you try this new wine from our winery?

194
10:55.961 --> 10:57.600
It hasn't been released yet.

195
10:57.600 --> 10:59.560
All right, thank you.

196
11:04.401 --> 11:06.281
The color is vibrant.

197
11:06.281 --> 11:08.241
The legs are moderate.

198
11:15.000 --> 11:16.281
It has a mellow mouthfeel.

199
11:16.281 --> 11:18.754
The blackcurrant notes are striking.

200
11:18.754 --> 11:21.441
The oak barrel aging is also very harmonious.

201
11:21.441 --> 11:23.114
It's indeed a fine wine. I'll take this one.

202
11:23.114 --> 11:24.761
All right. Thank you.

203
11:28.000 --> 11:29.881
I hope he likes it.

204
11:34.974 --> 11:36.801
Mr. Chen, let me take that for you.

205
11:36.801 --> 11:38.040
Okay.

206
11:38.760 --> 11:40.674
Let me give you some instructions.

207
11:40.674 --> 11:42.127
This bottle, Angel's Wings,

208
11:42.127 --> 11:44.600
goes into the blind box for the exchange.

209
11:44.600 --> 11:45.760
This bottle, Count Eternity,

210
11:45.760 --> 11:47.680
should be placed in the common area cabinet

211
11:47.680 --> 11:48.680
for everyone to drink.

212
11:48.680 --> 11:50.321
Understood, Mr. Chen.

213
11:50.321 --> 11:52.041
Wan.

214
11:52.041 --> 11:53.240
Go enjoy yourself.

215
11:53.240 --> 11:54.321
I see a friend.

216
11:54.321 --> 11:56.000
Who are you going after now?

217
11:56.000 --> 11:57.720
Your pickup lines are so old-fashioned.

218
11:57.720 --> 11:59.961
It's an acquaintance. I'll be right back.

219
11:59.961 --> 12:01.360
Don't mix them up.

220
12:01.360 --> 12:05.760
Remember, the one with the red ribbon goes to the common area.

221
12:05.760 --> 12:07.321
This bottle goes to the blind box area.

222
12:07.321 --> 12:09.241
- Don't mix them up. - No problem.

223
12:10.041 --> 12:11.440
Chen Wan.

224
12:15.240 --> 12:16.601
You're calling me?

225
12:23.081 --> 12:25.081
He's coming.

226
12:25.081 --> 12:26.560
That's okay?

227
12:29.161 --> 12:30.961
Mr. Zhao.

228
12:30.961 --> 12:32.561
Who is this?

229
12:32.561 --> 12:33.961
This is Chen Wan.

230
12:33.961 --> 12:35.081
Hello.

231
12:35.081 --> 12:36.801
I'm an old classmate of Mr. Zhao's.

232
12:36.801 --> 12:38.041
You can call me Felipe.

233
12:38.041 --> 12:39.801
Hello, Mr. Felipe.

234
12:39.801 --> 12:43.961
He's even more handsome than you, Mr. Zhao.

235
12:43.961 --> 12:45.880
- Thank you. - Felipe.

236
12:45.880 --> 12:49.201
I didn't know you researched Eastern beauty.

237
12:49.201 --> 12:54.680
European royalty has always loved Eastern beauty the most.

238
12:56.520 --> 12:57.961
I've been looking for you two for ages.

239
12:57.961 --> 12:59.721
So, this is where you've been hiding.

240
13:01.087 --> 13:02.994
- Captain Zhao. - Long time no see.

241
13:02.994 --> 13:05.400
- Long time no see. - Captain Zhao.

242
13:07.000 --> 13:09.081
Excuse me.

243
13:09.081 --> 13:10.361
It's all right.

244
13:11.321 --> 13:13.201
Thank you, Mr. Zhao.

245
13:13.201 --> 13:16.081
If there's nothing else, I'll take my leave.

246
13:21.361 --> 13:23.120
Sheng Ge, do you still remember me?

247
13:23.120 --> 13:24.161
I'm Yao Jia Nan.

248
13:24.161 --> 13:25.441
Yao Jia Nan from the rowing team.

249
13:25.441 --> 13:27.201
We represented Royal Tech together

250
13:27.201 --> 13:29.720
in the Rhine Spring Rowing Regatta.

251
13:29.720 --> 13:31.281
Did you forget?

252
13:31.281 --> 13:33.120
Yes, I remember back then,

253
13:33.120 --> 13:35.720
you were the assistant coach for the ski team.

254
13:35.720 --> 13:36.801
That's right.

255
13:36.801 --> 13:38.441
Do you guys remember?

256
13:38.441 --> 13:41.030
A Caucasian student at the ski race looked down on us.

257
13:41.030 --> 13:42.041
- Yes. - I remember.

258
13:42.041 --> 13:43.120
In the final race,

259
13:43.120 --> 13:46.240
Captain Zhao led us to a total victory.

260
13:46.240 --> 13:47.720
When we took the trophy,

261
13:47.720 --> 13:51.640
that Caucasian's face was priceless.

262
13:51.640 --> 13:54.520
But then again, after that race,

263
13:54.520 --> 13:56.600
Captain Zhao rarely hung out with us.

264
13:56.600 --> 13:58.520
I've been too busy lately.

265
13:58.520 --> 14:00.081
It's been a long time.

266
14:01.561 --> 14:04.440
Do you regret not accepting that offer back then?

267
14:08.760 --> 14:11.360
If you had accepted it,

268
14:11.360 --> 14:13.161
the person competing by his side

269
14:13.161 --> 14:16.001
and traveling the world would have been you.

270
14:19.561 --> 14:21.680
I'm just one of many.

271
14:22.281 --> 14:24.120
That's still better than drinking to death

272
14:24.120 --> 14:27.361
for the sake of the company.

273
14:28.561 --> 14:30.041
There are no "ifs."

274
14:30.041 --> 14:31.281
Actually, the way things are now...

275
14:31.281 --> 14:33.118
is already the best choice.

276
14:33.118 --> 14:34.161
Sure.

277
14:34.161 --> 14:36.960
Mr. Zhao, two rounds of wine have been served.

278
14:36.960 --> 14:39.600
Tell me, which one is your favorite?

279
14:39.600 --> 14:42.427
There are still many wines to be served.

280
14:42.427 --> 14:44.640
I can't jump to conclusions.

281
14:44.640 --> 14:48.201
Mr. Zhao, you're as airtight as ever.

282
14:48.201 --> 14:50.320
Yes, I think so, too.

283
14:52.801 --> 14:54.640
We can try it next time.

284
14:54.640 --> 14:55.947
Yes.

285
14:56.880 --> 15:01.640
This one tastes like butterflies dancing on the tongue.

286
15:03.000 --> 15:04.760
I didn't expect Chinese winemaking

287
15:04.760 --> 15:07.240
to have reached such wonderful heights.

288
15:07.240 --> 15:08.967
It's pretty good. I like it.

289
15:08.967 --> 15:11.321
That's rare. He actually said he likes it.

290
15:11.321 --> 15:13.281
Whose wine is so lucky?

291
15:13.281 --> 15:15.040
It's not mine.

292
15:16.921 --> 15:18.161
Wan.

293
15:18.161 --> 15:19.201
That concentric knot...

294
15:19.201 --> 15:21.001
Isn't that your wine?

295
15:22.760 --> 15:24.201
Go and claim it.

296
15:24.201 --> 15:25.201
No need.

297
15:25.201 --> 15:27.121
The most important thing is that he likes it.

298
15:31.520 --> 15:33.281
I won't go.

299
15:33.281 --> 15:35.921
Jia Nan, you chose this bottle of wine?

300
15:35.921 --> 15:37.000
Oh, right!

301
15:37.000 --> 15:38.760
Do you know why I chose this bottle?

302
15:38.760 --> 15:40.120
Back when Captain Zhao led us

303
15:40.120 --> 15:42.281
at the victory party for our team...

304
15:42.281 --> 15:45.401
- Xuan. - he brought a cassis-scented dry red.

305
15:45.401 --> 15:48.041
I still remember it to this day.

306
15:48.041 --> 15:49.840
Xuan. Don't get worked up yet.

307
15:49.840 --> 15:51.841
Let me ask someone first.

308
15:53.840 --> 15:55.201
Hello.

309
15:55.201 --> 15:56.240
I'd like to ask,

310
15:56.240 --> 15:59.921
where were Mr. Chen Wan's two bottles of wine placed?

311
15:59.921 --> 16:01.760
Let me check for you.

312
16:01.760 --> 16:04.321
Mr. Chen, your Count Eternity is in the blind box area.

313
16:04.321 --> 16:06.201
Angel's Wings is in the public area.

314
16:06.201 --> 16:08.281
They're swapped.

315
16:08.281 --> 16:10.000
Keep your voice down.

316
16:10.000 --> 16:11.561
This is their mistake.

317
16:11.561 --> 16:12.561
No.

318
16:12.561 --> 16:13.681
It's my mistake.

319
16:13.681 --> 16:15.881
I shouldn't have left it to others.

320
16:16.840 --> 16:18.241
How could you...

321
16:19.240 --> 16:20.921
I don't care.

322
16:20.921 --> 16:22.600
Xuan.

323
16:22.600 --> 16:24.041
We're here to discuss a partnership.

324
16:24.041 --> 16:25.520
We must focus on the big picture.

325
16:25.520 --> 16:26.961
What big picture?

326
16:26.961 --> 16:28.840
This wine...

327
16:28.840 --> 16:32.240
You visited countless wineries, big and small, just to find it.

328
16:32.240 --> 16:34.721
Your stomach condition almost flared up.

329
16:35.600 --> 16:37.761
We can't let that guy take credit so easily.

330
16:39.520 --> 16:40.853
Forget it.

331
16:42.081 --> 16:43.921
From the very beginning,

332
16:43.921 --> 16:47.120
I just wanted him to have good wine.

333
16:47.120 --> 16:50.001
In a way, my wish has come true.

334
16:52.441 --> 16:54.320
This is so frustrating.

335
16:58.441 --> 16:59.801
Mr. Zhao.

336
16:59.801 --> 17:01.961
Would you consider listing this bottle?

337
17:01.961 --> 17:04.480
I haven't tried them all yet.

338
17:04.480 --> 17:06.881
Let's wait and see.

339
17:06.881 --> 17:08.560
Sheng Ge's standards are as high as ever.

340
17:08.560 --> 17:09.681
Even this didn't make the cut.

341
17:09.681 --> 17:10.961
It's okay, Jia Nan.

342
17:10.961 --> 17:13.040
Don't be disappointed. Try again next time.

343
17:13.040 --> 17:14.641
Okay.

344
17:14.641 --> 17:17.761
I'll find a better wine for the Captain next time.

345
17:18.800 --> 17:23.921
Next time, we should go to the cellar for a tasting.

346
17:23.921 --> 17:26.520
Okay, I'll come with you.

347
17:35.520 --> 17:36.860
Wan.

348
17:39.800 --> 17:43.800
It seems that no matter how hard I try to find one,

349
17:43.800 --> 17:46.441
I still can't satisfy him.

350
17:49.800 --> 17:51.240
Wan.

351
17:51.240 --> 17:52.361
Don't mind him.

352
17:52.361 --> 17:54.641
That's just how he is.

353
17:54.641 --> 17:57.241
Nothing is ever good enough for him.

354
18:00.560 --> 18:02.961
I'm fine. It's almost time.

355
18:02.961 --> 18:04.520
The elder Mr. He is arriving.

356
18:04.520 --> 18:06.760
We need to go and get ready.

357
18:06.760 --> 18:08.048
Let's go.

358
18:21.240 --> 18:23.800
Hello, Mr. Felipe.

359
18:23.800 --> 18:26.641
Are you satisfied with our cocktail party today?

360
18:26.641 --> 18:27.800
Definitely.

361
18:27.800 --> 18:32.161
There's an ancient Chinese proverb, "Broadening your horizons."

362
18:32.161 --> 18:35.920
Today, I've not only tasted great Chinese wine,

363
18:35.920 --> 18:39.480
but seen Chinese beauties.

364
18:39.480 --> 18:42.000
Where is this beauty?

365
18:42.000 --> 18:44.161
Yes, he's Zhao's friend.

366
18:44.161 --> 18:46.000
Zhao, where is your friend?

367
18:46.000 --> 18:48.681
Perhaps you will see him again next time.

368
18:48.681 --> 18:51.841
I have some matters to discuss with Mr. He.

369
18:51.841 --> 18:53.961
So, I'll take my leave first.

370
18:53.961 --> 18:57.441
Okay, I guess I'll drink on my own.

371
18:57.441 --> 19:00.080
Take your time with the talk.

372
19:07.320 --> 19:09.921
I'm troubling you handsome young men.

373
19:09.921 --> 19:12.201
You have to play cards with an old man.

374
19:12.201 --> 19:13.240
Not at all.

375
19:13.240 --> 19:14.800
Mr. He, you watched us grow up.

376
19:14.800 --> 19:17.201
Playing with our elders is only right.

377
19:18.560 --> 19:22.040
Even my favorite tea has been brewed.

378
19:22.040 --> 19:23.401
We should be thanking you

379
19:23.401 --> 19:25.681
for hosting such a wonderful party.

380
19:25.681 --> 19:27.000
And this is...

381
19:27.000 --> 19:28.121
I forgot to introduce him.

382
19:28.121 --> 19:29.921
This is Chen Wan. He's great at cards.

383
19:29.921 --> 19:32.881
Even Shen Zong Nian couldn't recruit him with all his money.

384
19:32.881 --> 19:34.161
You flatter me, Mr. Tan.

385
19:34.161 --> 19:36.347
Nice to meet you, Mr. He.

386
19:37.121 --> 19:39.520
Ms. Xu, I'm Chen Wan.

387
19:39.520 --> 19:41.240
So, you're Chen Wan?

388
19:41.240 --> 19:42.760
Ms. Xu, you know of me?

389
19:42.760 --> 19:44.841
I hear them mention you often.

390
19:44.841 --> 19:46.760
A pleasure to meet you.

391
19:46.760 --> 19:48.240
All right, enough with the pleasantries.

392
19:48.240 --> 19:49.961
Let's get started.

393
19:49.961 --> 19:51.881
Learn from Chen Wan.

394
19:51.881 --> 19:53.881
See how well-spoken he is.

395
19:53.881 --> 19:55.881
All right.

396
19:55.881 --> 19:59.161
Everyone, please show me your skills.

397
20:00.520 --> 20:02.401
Then I'll be the dealer.

398
20:03.320 --> 20:06.161
Wan, we're here to talk business today.

399
20:06.161 --> 20:07.201
I don't know what's up today.

400
20:07.201 --> 20:08.760
Zhao Sheng Ge has a total poker face,

401
20:08.760 --> 20:10.760
and Shen Zong Nian is always an ice block.

402
20:10.760 --> 20:12.240
You'll have to be the good cop tonight.

403
20:12.240 --> 20:13.541
Got it?

404
20:16.441 --> 20:18.601
Mr. Zhao and Mr. He are on one team.

405
20:18.601 --> 20:20.721
Wan and Ms. Xu are on the other.

406
20:27.881 --> 20:29.180
Let's play.

407
20:37.560 --> 20:38.860
Ten.

408
20:40.280 --> 20:43.721
Sheng Ge, they're coming in strong.

409
20:47.080 --> 20:48.387
Jack.

410
20:59.040 --> 21:01.681
Chen Wan, it's your turn.

411
21:01.681 --> 21:03.040
Pair of twos.

412
21:03.040 --> 21:04.280
Pair of kings.

413
21:04.280 --> 21:05.641
I'll take that.

414
21:07.401 --> 21:08.694
Pair of sixes.

415
21:13.681 --> 21:15.080
Chen Wan.

416
21:18.080 --> 21:19.600
Chen Wan!

417
21:21.121 --> 21:23.121
Don't you have any points?

418
21:23.121 --> 21:24.760
I'm sorry.

419
21:24.760 --> 21:28.441
Ying Ying, that's cheating.

420
21:28.441 --> 21:31.800
You two shouldn't be communicating.

421
21:31.800 --> 21:33.241
Let's continue.

422
21:35.201 --> 21:36.521
King.

423
21:42.881 --> 21:45.240
Mr. Chen, when I had the high card earlier,

424
21:45.240 --> 21:46.841
you could've given me ten points.

425
21:46.841 --> 21:48.240
But you played a six instead.

426
21:48.240 --> 21:49.480
And I had a pair of twos of clubs.

427
21:49.480 --> 21:52.040
You should've been more aggressive.

428
21:52.040 --> 21:53.280
I'm sorry.

429
21:53.280 --> 21:55.881
You went easy on us on purpose.

430
21:55.881 --> 21:58.401
No, I'm just not as skilled.

431
21:58.401 --> 21:59.921
I admit defeat.

432
22:11.800 --> 22:14.560
Finding a card is taking you this long?

433
22:21.000 --> 22:24.320
Your skills have slipped since last time.

434
22:26.921 --> 22:30.800
Wan, we're on a team this round.

435
22:30.800 --> 22:32.681
Sheng Ge and Ying Ying will be a team.

436
22:32.681 --> 22:35.240
Let's see if they have any chemistry.

437
22:35.240 --> 22:37.121
All right, you call the shots.

438
22:37.121 --> 22:39.160
- I'm fine with anything. - All right.

439
22:46.201 --> 22:48.201
Chen Wan.

440
22:48.201 --> 22:52.280
Show me the same courage you had at the hearing.

441
22:52.280 --> 22:54.161
You were also at the hearing?

442
22:54.161 --> 22:58.280
Of course, I recognized you the moment you arrived.

443
22:59.520 --> 23:01.361
Grandpa.

444
23:01.361 --> 23:05.800
You told me he was so calm, he was almost cold-blooded.

445
23:05.800 --> 23:08.401
But today, he seems like a completely different person.

446
23:08.401 --> 23:10.560
He's more like what Felipe said...

447
23:10.560 --> 23:13.080
An Eastern beauty.

448
23:13.080 --> 23:15.161
Young man.

449
23:15.161 --> 23:17.240
Aren't you afraid of Luo Gan Sheng?

450
23:17.240 --> 23:18.520
I've already offended him.

451
23:18.520 --> 23:19.921
There's no use in being afraid.

452
23:19.921 --> 23:21.121
You don't need to fear him.

453
23:21.121 --> 23:23.520
You have so many friends here.

454
23:23.520 --> 23:25.921
Then I must thank you for your support, Mr. He.

455
23:27.080 --> 23:28.961
The way Sheng Ge is playing...

456
23:28.961 --> 23:31.600
It doesn't look like he's giving He Sheng Yuan any room to breathe.

457
23:32.921 --> 23:34.441
They said they were here to discuss a partnership.

458
23:34.441 --> 23:35.641
I don't know what's with Zhao Sheng Ge.

459
23:35.641 --> 23:37.800
He's had a poker face the whole time.

460
23:39.161 --> 23:40.520
Game over.

461
23:41.881 --> 23:43.601
I'm sorry. We lost again.

462
23:43.601 --> 23:45.560
It's not your fault.

463
23:45.560 --> 23:49.161
Sheng Ge was just too good at feeding Zhi Ying cards.

464
23:49.161 --> 23:50.760
He wouldn't even wear a ring when gifted one.

465
23:50.760 --> 23:52.401
Could it be...

466
23:52.401 --> 23:53.921
an engagement ring?

467
23:53.921 --> 23:55.201
With one sentence from Mr. He,

468
23:55.201 --> 23:58.001
all of Hai City will be talking.

469
24:08.520 --> 24:10.880
Have a drink. Relax a bit.

470
24:15.240 --> 24:17.481
I'll pass. I just took some medicine.

471
24:19.921 --> 24:21.601
Wan.

472
24:21.601 --> 24:24.201
Sheng Ge isn't usually like this.

473
24:24.201 --> 24:26.401
I don't know what's gotten into him tonight.

474
24:29.441 --> 24:31.161
What are you thinking?

475
24:34.441 --> 24:36.121
It's okay, you don't have to force a smile.

476
24:36.121 --> 24:37.921
I'm really fine.

477
24:42.201 --> 24:44.001
You believe in him.

478
24:46.760 --> 24:48.360
He is free.

479
24:49.080 --> 24:51.040
And I am free, too.

480
24:51.961 --> 24:55.401
I don't know how to explain it to you,

481
24:55.401 --> 24:56.800
but I feel that...

482
24:56.800 --> 24:58.088
Xuan.

483
24:58.881 --> 25:00.800
You don't need to worry about me.

484
25:02.000 --> 25:04.601
I do have a crush on him.

485
25:04.601 --> 25:08.641
But in terms of feelings, we are equals.

486
25:08.641 --> 25:11.881
Zhao Sheng Ge has his freedom,

487
25:11.881 --> 25:15.040
and I have the freedom to stop dreaming.

488
25:16.760 --> 25:19.280
This game is mine.

489
25:19.280 --> 25:22.401
The initiative... is in my hands.

490
25:34.000 --> 25:35.520
I'm really fine.

491
25:35.520 --> 25:37.880
If you have work to do, go ahead.

492
25:40.000 --> 25:41.481
You're really fine?

493
25:43.641 --> 25:45.320
I'm really fine.

494
25:45.320 --> 25:46.840
I'll get going.

495
25:54.601 --> 25:56.720
Mr. Zhao, I've decanted the wine for you.

496
25:56.720 --> 25:58.520
- Take it away. - Yes, sir.

497
25:58.520 --> 25:59.834
Wait.

498
26:00.681 --> 26:01.681
Bring it here.

499
26:01.681 --> 26:03.040
Just give it to me.

500
26:37.121 --> 26:38.160
I heard Baisheng will participate in

501
26:38.160 --> 26:39.841
Minglong's Lychee Bay project, right?

502
26:39.841 --> 26:40.880
Yes.

503
26:40.880 --> 26:43.280
Zhao Sheng Ge of Minglong is very sincere.

504
26:43.280 --> 26:45.201
Hai City will soon have a wedding of the century.

505
26:45.201 --> 26:46.520
Right, Mr. Zhao and Ms. Xu?

506
26:46.520 --> 26:48.080
Aren't you a financial reporter?

507
26:48.080 --> 26:50.441
Why are you so gossipy?

508
26:52.601 --> 26:54.280
Let's go.

509
27:53.641 --> 27:55.280
How unlucky.

510
28:12.681 --> 28:13.720
Chen Wan.

511
28:13.720 --> 28:15.441
It's you.

512
28:23.760 --> 28:25.840
These guys are serious?

513
28:42.361 --> 28:43.401
You go first.

514
28:43.401 --> 28:45.360
Be careful!

515
29:08.080 --> 29:09.401
Gambling with your life against me?

516
29:09.401 --> 29:10.641
Fine.

517
29:10.641 --> 29:12.921
Let's see whose life is tougher.

518
30:30.094 --> 30:31.161
Ms. Xu.

519
30:31.161 --> 30:33.040
Chen Wan, are you okay?

520
30:33.040 --> 30:34.961
I'm fine, Ms. Xu.

521
30:36.000 --> 30:37.520
You're injured.

522
30:37.520 --> 30:38.760
I'll take you to the hospital.

523
30:38.760 --> 30:40.201
There's really no need.

524
30:40.201 --> 30:41.601
I'm fine.

525
30:41.601 --> 30:43.280
No need to trouble you, Ms. Xu.

526
30:43.280 --> 30:44.961
But your injury is very serious.

527
30:44.961 --> 30:47.161
Ms. Xu, I can handle it myself.

528
30:47.161 --> 30:49.480
- Don't worry. - Miss, their target was you.

529
30:49.480 --> 30:52.001
It's too dangerous here. Let's leave quickly.

530
30:53.280 --> 30:56.040
Thank you so much. I owe you one.

531
30:56.040 --> 30:58.040
If you need anything, please let me know.

532
30:58.040 --> 31:00.040
All right, Ms. Xu.

533
31:02.040 --> 31:03.347
Let's go.

534
31:12.000 --> 31:14.120
Why are you wearing the family ring?

535
31:15.201 --> 31:17.520
The old man asked me to wear it.

536
31:17.520 --> 31:20.280
It's bad luck to send someone to the hospital on a day like this.

537
31:21.480 --> 31:23.001
How filial of you.

538
31:24.760 --> 31:27.161
Mr. He is personally supporting you this time.

539
31:27.161 --> 31:29.161
He seems to have great confidence in you.

540
31:34.240 --> 31:36.441
What do you plan to do?

541
31:36.441 --> 31:37.921
What about you?

542
31:39.121 --> 31:40.681
It's been so many years.

543
31:48.921 --> 31:50.800
I've moved on just like that.

544
31:50.800 --> 31:52.441
That's right.

545
31:52.441 --> 31:56.001
Just being happy... is good enough.

546
31:57.681 --> 31:59.641
You don't plan on telling him?

547
32:01.760 --> 32:03.520
I can't tell him.

548
32:13.441 --> 32:14.481
Zhao Sheng Ge.

549
32:14.481 --> 32:15.720
I need to pull the CCTV footage from the intersection.

550
32:15.720 --> 32:17.320
I was attacked.

551
32:17.320 --> 32:18.974
Luckily, Chen Wan saved me.

552
32:18.974 --> 32:20.001
He's injured.

553
32:20.001 --> 32:21.554
But he wouldn't let me take him to the hospital.

554
32:21.554 --> 32:24.053
He's still at the scene of the accident.

555
32:24.053 --> 32:25.800
I'm off to check the surveillance footage.

556
32:25.800 --> 32:27.760
Zhi Xuan, come with me. Something happened to Chen Wan.

557
32:27.760 --> 32:29.401
What's going on?

558
32:31.320 --> 32:32.800
Mr. Zhao is in such a hurry.

559
32:32.800 --> 32:34.681
Why did he rush out like that?

560
32:38.973 --> 32:41.247
- Hello? - Found him at the fourth intersection.

561
32:41.247 --> 32:43.641
The security team sent over all the data.

562
32:43.641 --> 32:45.161
I see.

563
32:48.673 --> 32:51.067
Well... It's the remnants of the Baihe Hall.

564
32:51.067 --> 32:52.120
As for the specific details...

565
32:52.120 --> 32:54.001
we'll have to ask Chen Wan.

566
32:56.081 --> 32:57.113
Then...

567
32:57.113 --> 32:58.761
Let's talk when we get there.

568
34:03.800 --> 34:06.000
Mount Fuji is too far away.

569
34:06.000 --> 34:08.001
I can't see it anymore.

570
34:55.200 --> 34:56.840
Chen Wan.

571
34:58.560 --> 35:00.280
Chen Wan.

572
35:07.160 --> 35:09.000
Chen Wan.

573
35:09.000 --> 35:10.721
Chen Wan.
